# Default Abseil flagfile for verible-verilog-format shipped with rules_verible.
#
# This file is intentionally empty — it does NOT set any flags. Downstream
# consumers should provide their own flagfile(s) and point the
# //verible:format_flagfiles label_flag at a filegroup containing them:
#
#   build --@rules_verible//verible:format_flagfiles=//path/to:my_format_flagfiles
#
# Available flags: `verible-verilog-format --help`.
# Format: one `--flag=value` per line; `#` starts a comment.
